# The third-party images psi runs beyond the platform's own list (SEB's
# infrastructure/hetzner/images.list), in the same format, copied into the estate's Harbor
# (public project `mirror`) by the same script:
#
#   IM_LIST=<psi>/estate/images.list <seb>/infrastructure/hetzner/scripts/harbor-mirror-images.sh dev
#
#   <class> <upstream repository> <tag> <linux/amd64 manifest digest> [# why]
#
# A reference names registry.psizone.ro/mirror/<upstream repository>:<tag>@<digest>.
# NEW IMAGE / NEW VERSION: add a line, run the script, then reference it.
